gWP(){return"Lowers <spd>speed</spd>, so it acts less often."},
gWQ(){return"Speed Down lowers the <spd>Speed</spd> by a percentage while it lasts. The turn meter fills more slowly, so the Ovaling gets its turn later and less often."},
gWj(){return"Raises <spd>speed</spd>, so it acts more often."},
gWk(){return"Speed Up raises the <spd>Speed</spd> by a percentage while it lasts. The turn meter fills faster, so the Ovaling gets its turn sooner and more often."},
gX0(){return"Lowers <atk>attack</atk>, so its hits do less damage."},
gX1(){return"Attack Down lowers the <atk>Attack</atk> by a percentage while it lasts. All damage the Ovaling deals shrinks with it. Some bosses are immune."},
gWR(){return"Raises <atk>attack</atk>, so its hits do more damage."},
gWS(){return"Attack Up raises the <atk>Attack</atk> by a percentage while it lasts. All damage the Ovaling deals grows with it."},
gW_(){return"Lowers <def>defense</def>, so it takes more damage."},
gW0(){return"Defense Down lowers the <def>Defense</def> by a percentage while it lasts. Every hit on the Ovaling does more damage."},
gWd(){return"Raises <def>defense</def>, so it takes less damage."},
gWe(){return"Defense Up raises the <def>Defense</def> by a percentage while it lasts. Every hit on the Ovaling does less damage."},
gWH(){return"Heals at the start of each of its turns."},
gWI(){return"At the start of each of its own turns, the Ovaling heals a part of its highest <hp>HP</hp>, until the effect runs out."},
gWN(){return"Soaks up damage before <hp>HP</hp> is lost."},
gWO(){return"A shield is a cushion made of a part of the highest <hp>HP</hp>. Damage hits the shield first and only then the <hp>HP</hp>. A shield has no duration and stays until it is used up. Every shield also reduces all damage taken by at least 5 % as long as something is left of it. Then the damage reduction icon shows."},
gWn(){return"Restores <hp>HP</hp> at once."},
gWo(){return"Heal restores a part of the target's highest <hp>HP</hp> immediately. <hp>HP</hp> never goes above the maximum."},
gWv(){return"Heals by a share of the damage dealt."},
gWw(){return"A share of the damage the attacker deals comes back to it as <hp>HP</hp>, with every hit."},
gWx(){return"Empties part of the turn meter."},
gWy(){return"Turn Meter Down takes a percentage off the target's turn meter, so its next turn comes later."},
